## 4. Cryptographic Provenance Receipt (`VideoReceipt`)
To prevent "status laundering" and ensure deterministic traceability:
- Every generated Short emits a tamper-evident `VideoReceipt`:
  - `receipt_id`: 16-hex deterministic identifier.
  - `source_media_hash`: SHA-256 of source transcript/audio stream.
  - `composition_hash`: SHA-256 of serialized timeline JSON.
  - `edl_segments`: List of `(source_start, source_end)` cuts.
  - `render_preset`: Target resolution, FPS, and container codec parameters.
